{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785305484654,"sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_aZRxZqsTDXuSFuKOPs0AZF0m","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-config.json"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-config.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"topic\": \"Investigate whether every skill and skill-advisor related JSON across .opencode/skills is as optimized, automated, effective, tested, and integrated as it can be, and identify the highest-leverage gaps. In-scope JSON surfaces: per-skill root metadata (graph-metadata.json, description.json, mode-registry.json, hub-router.json, leaf-manifest.json [generated], leaf-manifest.config.json, leaf-aliases.json, command-metadata.json); advisor-side data (skill-graph DB and index inputs, intent-signal data, compiled-route-manifest, watcher-ingested identity); and the generation and validation pipeline (init_skill.py, generate-leaf-manifest.cjs, generate-description.js, backfill-graph-metadata.js, ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs, ci-leaf-manifest-freshness.cjs, compiled-route-manifest.cjs). Cover five dimensions: (1) inventory and current state; (2) optimization; (3) automation gaps; (4) effectiveness; (5) testing and integration. Non-goals: do not implement fixes, do not redesign advisor scoring, do not change H/S class contract fundamentally. Deliverable: ranked opportunity map with file:line citations.\",\n3:   \"maxIterations\": 5,\n4:   \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n5:   \"antiConvergence\": {\n6:     \"minIterations\": 5,\n7:     \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n8:     \"st