{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785305501902,"sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_pyV3ZPXLR25B4exZVLll5Uo5","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-strategy.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-strategy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Deep Research Strategy - grok-high lineage\n2: \n3: ## 2. TOPIC\n4: Investigate whether every skill and skill-advisor related JSON across `.opencode/skills` is as optimized, automated, effective, tested, and integrated as it can be, and identify the highest-leverage gaps. Cover five dimensions (one focus per iteration): (1) inventory/current state, (2) optimization, (3) automation gaps, (4) effectiveness, (5) testing and integration. Findings only; cite `file:line`. Deliverable: ranked opportunity map.\n5: \n6: ---\n7: \n8: <!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n9: ## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n10: \n11: - [ ] Which fields are redundant, unused, or drift-prone across skill-root and advisor JSON?\n12: - [ ] What still requires hand-authoring that scaffolder/generators could emit or auto-validate?\n13: - [ ] Do intent-signals and load-bearing fields actually drive advisor routing quality?\n14: - [ ] Where are test/CI and end-to-end scaffold→gate→ingest→routing gaps sharpest?\n15: <!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n16: \n17: ---\n18: \n19: ## 4. NON-GOALS\n20: - Do not implement fixes (findings only)\n21: - Do not redesign the advisor scoring algorithm\n22: - Do not change the H or S class contract fundamentally\n23: - Do not write outside this lineage artifact directory\n24: \n25: ---\n26: \n27: ## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n28: - `stopPolicy: max-iterations` — run all 5 iterations regardless of early convergence signals\n29: - Convergence before iteration 5 is telemetry only; broaden angles instead of synthesizing early\n30: - Max iterations: 5\n31: \n32: ---\n33: \n34: <!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n35: ## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n36: - [x] Which JSON types exist fleet-wide, and which are authored vs generated per H/S class? (iteration 1)\n37: <!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n38: \n39: ---\n40: \n41: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n42: <!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n43: ## 7. WHAT WORKED\n44: - Fleet presence census + ci-skill-root-metadata JSON: grounded H/S matrix in live bytes (iteration 1)\n45: - Tracing named pipeline scripts to owning packages: revealed skill-root vs spec-folder schema split (iteration 1)\n46: <!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n47: \n48: ---\n49: \n50: <!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n51: ## 8. WHAT FAILED\n52: - Assuming generate-description.js/backfill-graph-metadata.js optimize skill-root JSON — wrong domain (iteration 1)\n53: <!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n54: \n55: ---\n56: \n57: <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n58: ## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n59: [None yet]\n60: <!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n61: \n62: ---\n63: \n64: <!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n65: ## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n66: [None yet]\n67: <!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n68: \n69: ---\n70: \n71: <!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n72: ## 10A. SATURATED DIRECTIONS AND DIVERGENCE FRONTIER\n73: - Completed pivots: 0\n74: - Failed pivots: 0\n75: - Audited overrides: 0\n76: - Saturated: none yet\n77: - Pivot lineage: none yet\n78: - Remaining frontier: none recorded\n79: <!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n80: \n81: ---\n82: \n83: <!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n84: ## 11A. CARRIED-FORWARD OPEN QUESTIONS\n85: [None yet]\n86: <!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n87: \n88: ---\n89: \n90: <!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n91: ## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n92: Dimension (1) Inventory and current state — every JSON type, authored versus generated, presence per H or S class, current automation coverage across the fleet and pipeline scripts.\n93: <!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n94: \n95: ---\n96: \n97: <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n98: ## 12. KNOWN CONTEXT\n99: - resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage gate\n100: - Parent charter: `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/spec.md`\n101: - Contract under study: `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/references/shared/skill-root-metadata-contract.md`\n102: - Fleet: 7 H hubs + 4 S standalones (11 top-level skill roots)\n103: - Fan-out lineage label: `grok-high`; session `fanout-grok-high-1785305275596-oro54j`\n104: - Executor: cli-cursor / cursor-grok-4.5-high\n105: - Sibling lineages (concurrent, do not read/write): `sol-high`, `glm-high`\n106: \n107: ### Bounded Context Snapshot\n108: \n109: - Source pointers: skill-root metadata contract; `ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs`; `generate-leaf-manifest.cjs`; system-skill-advisor graph/ingest; `compiled-route-manifest.cjs`\n110: - Reuse candidates: packets 021–028 under `019-skill-routing-refactor`\n111: - Integration points: advisor watcher ingest of `graph-metadata.json`; mode-registry + hub-router coupled discriminator; leaf-manifest generation/freshness\n112: - Constraints: findings only; H/S contract frozen; write only under `research/lineages/grok-high`\n113: \n114: ---\n115: \n116: ## 13. RESEARCH BOUNDARIES\n117: - Max iterations: 5\n118: - Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry only under max-iterations stop policy)\n119: - Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n120: - Progressive synthesis: true\n121: - research.md ownership: workflow-owned canonical synthesis output (lineage-local)\n122: - Current generation: 1\n123: - Started: 2026-07-29T06:08:30.000Z\n\n(End of file - total 123 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Deep Research Strategy - grok-high lineage\n\n## 2. TOPIC\nInvestigate whether every skill and skill-advisor related JSON across `.opencode/skills` is as optimized, automated, effective, tested, and integrated as it can be, and identify the highest-leverage gaps. Cover five dimensions (one focus per iteration): (1) inventory/current state, (2) optimization, (3) automation gaps, (4) effectiveness, (5) testing and integration. Findings only; cite `file:line`. Deliverable: ranked opportunity map.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n\n- [ ] Which fields are redundant, unused, or drift-prone across skill-root and advisor JSON?\n- [ ] What still requires hand-authoring that scaffolder/generators could emit or auto-validate?\n- [ ] Do intent-signals and load-bearing fields actually drive advisor routing quality?\n- [ ] Where are test/CI and end-to-end scaffold→gate→ingest→routing gaps sharpest?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n- Do not implement fixes (findings only)","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-strategy.md","text":"# Deep Research Strategy - grok-high lineage\n\n## 2. TOPIC\nInvestigate whether every skill and skill-advisor related JSON across `.opencode/skills` is as optimized, automated, effective, tested, and integrated as it can be, and identify the highest-leverage gaps. Cover five dimensions (one focus per iteration): (1) inventory/current state, (2) optimization, (3) automation gaps, (4) effectiveness, (5) testing and integration. Findings only; cite `file:line`. Deliverable: ranked opportunity map.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n\n- [ ] Which fields are redundant, unused, or drift-prone across skill-root and advisor JSON?\n- [ ] What still requires hand-authoring that scaffolder/generators could emit or auto-validate?\n- [ ] Do intent-signals and load-bearing fields actually drive advisor routing quality?\n- [ ] Where are test/CI and end-to-end scaffold→gate→ingest→routing gaps sharpest?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n- Do not implement fixes (findings only)\n- Do not redesign the advisor scoring algorithm\n- Do not change the H or S class contract fundamentally\n- Do not write outside this lineage artifact directory\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n- `stopPolicy: max-iterations` — run all 5 iterations regardless of early convergence signals\n- Convergence before iteration 5 is telemetry only; broaden angles instead of synthesizing early\n- Max iterations: 5\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n- [x] Which JSON types exist fleet-wide, and which are authored vs generated per H/S class? (iteration 1)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\n- Fleet presence census + ci-skill-root-metadata JSON: grounded H/S matrix in live bytes (iteration 1)\n- Tracing named pipeline scripts to owning packages: revealed skill-root vs spec-folder schema split (iteration 1)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\n- Assuming generate-description.js/backfill-graph-metadata.js optimize skill-root JSON — wrong domain (iteration 1)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n## 10A. SATURATED DIRECTIONS AND DIVERGENCE FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Saturated: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n## 11A. CARRIED-FORWARD OPEN QUESTIONS\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\nDimension (1) Inventory and current state — every JSON type, authored versus generated, presence per H or S class, current automation coverage across the fleet and pipeline scripts.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n## 12. KNOWN CONTEXT\n- resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage gate\n- Parent charter: `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/spec.md`\n- Contract under study: `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/references/shared/skill-root-metadata-contract.md`\n- Fleet: 7 H hubs + 4 S standalones (11 top-level skill roots)\n- Fan-out lineage label: `grok-high`; session `fanout-grok-high-1785305275596-oro54j`\n- Executor: cli-cursor / cursor-grok-4.5-high\n- Sibling lineages (concurrent, do not read/write): `sol-high`, `glm-high`\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Source pointers: skill-root metadata contract; `ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs`; `generate-leaf-manifest.cjs`; system-skill-advisor graph/ingest; `compiled-route-manifest.cjs`\n- Reuse candidates: packets 021–028 under `019-skill-routing-refactor`\n- Integration points: advisor watcher ingest of `graph-metadata.json`; mode-registry + hub-router coupled discriminator; leaf-manifest generation/freshness\n- Constraints: findings only; H/S contract frozen; write only under `research/lineages/grok-high`\n\n---\n\n## 13. RESEARCH BOUNDARIES\n- Max iterations: 5\n- Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry only under max-iterations stop policy)\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Progressive synthesis: true\n- research.md ownership: workflow-owned canonical synthesis output (lineage-local)\n- Current generation: 1\n- Started: 2026-07-29T06:08:30.000Z","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":123,"totalLines":123,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/grok-high/deep-research-strategy.md","time":{"start":1785305501883,"end":1785305501900}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c2ab757f25bc067016a69999dbd908191a1f9513cc02ca5fb"}},"id":"prt_fac80108e0012bNRTEMIfOGay1","sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","messageID":"msg_fac7fd7ac001KcmRJxA4xs1GpT"}}
