{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785305635025,"sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_lv03LeqwfAd3Vs5MzmsP8xnt","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/deep-research-config.json\n+{\n+  \"topic\": \"Investigate whether every skill and skill-advisor related JSON across .opencode/skills is as optimized, automated, effective, tested, and integrated as it can be, and identify the highest-leverage gaps. In-scope JSON surfaces: per-skill root metadata (graph-metadata.json, description.json, mode-registry.json, hub-router.json, leaf-manifest.json [generated], leaf-manifest.config.json, leaf-aliases.json, command-metadata.json); advisor-side data (skill-graph DB and index inputs, intent-signal data, compiled-route-manifest, watcher-ingested identity); and the generation and validation pipeline (init_skill.py, generate-leaf-manifest.cjs, generate-description.js, backfill-graph-metadata.js, ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs, ci-leaf-manifest-freshness.cjs, compiled-route-manifest.cjs). Cover five dimensions: (1) inventory and current state; (2) optimization; (3) automation gaps; (4) effectiveness; (5) testing and integration. Non-goals: do not implement fixes, do not redesign advisor scoring, do not change H/S class contract fundamentally. Deliverable: ranked opportunity map with file:line citations.\",\n+  \"maxIterations\": 5,\n+  \"minIterations\": 5,\n+  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n+  \"antiConvergence\": {\n+    \"minIterations\": 5,\n+    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n+    \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n+    \"divergent\": {}\n+  },\n+  \"stuckThreshold\": 3,\n+  \"minIdeaObservations\": 2,\n+  \"maxDurationMinutes\": 120,\n+  \"maxToolCallsPerIteration\": 12,\n+  \"maxMinutesPerIteration\": 10,\n+  \"progressiveSynthesis\": true,\n+  \"specFolder\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research\",\n+  \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-29T06:10:56.169Z\",\n+  \"status\": \"initialized\",\n+  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n+  \"loop_type\": \"research\",\n+  \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n+  \"fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high\",\n+  \"resource_map_present\": false,\n+  \"resource_map\": {\n+    \"emit\": true\n+  },\n+  \"executor\": {\n+    \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n+    \"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.6-sol\",\n+    \"reasoningEffort\": null,\n+    \"serviceTier\": null,\n+    \"sandboxMode\": null,\n+    \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n+  },\n+  \"lineage\": {\n+    \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-1785305275596-oro54j\",\n+    \"parentSessionId\": null,\n+    \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n+    \"allowedModes\": [\"new\", \"resume\", \"restart\"],\n+    \"deferredModes\": [\"fork\", \"completed-continue\"],\n+    \"generation\": 1,\n+    \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n+    \"label\": \"sol-high\"\n+  },\n+  \"reducer\": {\n+    \"enabled\": true,\n+    \"version\": \"1.0\",\n+    \"registryFile\": \"findings-registry.json\",\n+    \"dashboardFile\": \"deep-research-dashboard.md\",\n+    \"strategyFile\": \"deep-research-strategy.md\",\n+    \"machineOwnedSections\": [\n+      \"key-questions\",\n+      \"answered-questions\",\n+      \"what-worked\",\n+      \"what-failed\",\n+      \"exhausted-approaches\",\n+      \"ruled-out-directions\",\n+      \"divergence-frontier\",\n+      \"next-focus\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"capabilityMatrixPath\": \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/assets/runtime-capabilities.json\",\n+  \"capabilityMatrixDocPath\": \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/guides/capability-matrix.md\",\n+  \"runtimeCapabilityResolver\": \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/runtime-capabilities.cjs\",\n+  \"reducerScriptPath\": \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs\",\n+  \"pauseSentinelPath\": \".deep-research-pause\",\n+  \"archiveRoot\": \"_archive\",\n+  \"migrationWindowDays\": 28,\n+  \"fileProtection\": {\n+    \"deep-research-config.json\": \"immutable\",\n+    \"deep-research-state.jsonl\": \"append-only\",\n+    \"deep-research-strategy.md\": \"mutable\",\n+    \"deep-research-dashboard.md\": \"auto-generated\",\n+    \"findings-registry.json\": \"auto-generated\",\n+    \"iteration-*.md\": \"write-once\",\n+    \"research.md\": \"mutable\"\n+  },\n+  \"_optimizerManaged\": {\n+    \"description\": \"Fields managed by the offline loop optimizer.\",\n+    \"manifestPath\": \".opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/scripts/optimizer/optimizer-manifest.json\",\n+    \"tunableFields\": [\"convergenceThreshold\", \"stuckThreshold\", \"maxIterations\"],\n+    \"lockedFields\": [\"lineage\", \"reducer\", \"fileProtection\", \"sessionId\", \"status\", \"antiConvergence.convergenceMode\", \"antiConvergence.stopPolicy\"],\n+    \"promotionMode\": \"advisory-only\"\n+  }\n+}\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/deep-research-state.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"Skill and advisor JSON optimization across .opencode/skills: inventory, optimization, automation, effectiveness, testing and integration\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"minIterations\":5,\"convergenceThreshold\":0.05,\"antiConvergence\":{\"convergenceMode\":\"default\",\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"divergent\":{}},\"stuckThreshold\":3,\"minIdeaObservations\":2,\"resource_map_present\":false,\"resource_map\":{\"emit\":true},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T06:10:56.169Z\",\"specFolder\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.openc