\n+- Use existing regression/evaluation evidence where available. Do not propose scoring-algorithm redesign.\n+- Cite `file:line` for every finding and explain which fields are load-bearing versus currently ineffective.\n+- Append exactly one canonical state record and matching delta record using iteration/run 4 and required route-proof fields.\n+- Convergence remains telemetry only; recommend dimension 5 next.\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md","relativePath":".opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@\n+DEEP-RESEARCH\n+Resolved route: mode=research; target_agent=@deep-research; execution=single_iteration; state_source=externalized_files; do_not_switch_mode=true\n+\n+# Deep-Research Iteration 4 Prompt Pack\n+\n+## STATE\n+\n+STATE SUMMARY (auto-generated):\n+Segment: 1 | Iteration: 4 of 5\n+Questions: 3/5 answered | Last focus: automation\n+Last 2 ratios: 0.92 -> 0.83 | Stuck count: 0\n+Resource map: resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage ga