{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785307738658,"sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_9I6r0gGggOBHSKZqaGrfW9iH","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research routing effectiveness","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE deep-research LEAF iteration from `/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-004.md`.\n\nThis is iteration 4 of 5 for detached lineage `sol-high`. Read state and prior iterations first. Focus only on effectiveness: trace actual metadata contributions through watcher ingest, graph/index projection, rank lanes, compiled hub routes, executor delegation, and fallbacks. Identify high-leverage intent-signal or activation gaps without redesigning scoring. Use regression/evaluation evidence where available. Do not read sibling lineage artifacts and do not write outside `sol-high`.\n\nProduce and verify iteration-004.md, exactly one canonical state append, delta iter-004.jsonl, and optional progressive lineage-local research.md. Every finding requires actual file:line citations. Do not implement fixes, edit reducer-owned files, or synthesize early. Return only the concise completion report."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_053654873ffePk2EkyJcKzsSGr\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 4 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Metadata-to-route effectiveness across ingest, advisor lanes, hub routing, delegation, and fallbacks  \n**Findings**: 6 findings (5 new, 1 partially new, 0 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.92  \n**Questions answered**: Effectiveness and routing-signal contribution  \n**Questions remaining**: 1  \n**Edge cases**: Contradictory evaluation baselines  \n**Recommended next focus**: Dimension 5—testing and integration coverage\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-004.md`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` (exactly one append)\n- `deltas/iter-004.jsonl`\n- `research.md` (progressive update)\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta matches canonical state record: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","sessionId":"ses_053654873ffePk2EkyJcKzsSGr","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research routing effectiveness","time":{"start":1785307248761,"end":1785307738653}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_064c0c6327305b9c016a69a06bcb888191b95099d1a6837adf"}},"id":"prt_fac9aa52a0011PmfG4KTlqY59F","sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","messageID":"msg_fac9a7b24001SDzxGhBebbohw4"}}
