{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785308255605,"sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_QIDguvpHE94SJzhowhvE19Bw","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research integration coverage","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE deep-research LEAF iteration from `/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/029-skill-json-optimization-research/research/lineages/sol-high/prompts/iteration-005.md`.\n\nThis is iteration 5 of 5 for detached lineage `sol-high`. Read state and all prior iterations first. Focus only on testing and integration: per-JSON unit/schema/freshness/CI coverage; end-to-end scaffold -> gate -> advisor ingest -> root selection -> compiled hub route; failure modes; fallback parity; source-change invalidation; natural-language per-mode evaluation. Verify whether tests assert behavior versus mere fixture presence. Do not read sibling lineage artifacts and do not write outside `sol-high`.\n\nProduce and verify iteration-005.md, exactly one canonical state append, delta iter-005.jsonl, and optional progressive lineage-local research.md. Every finding requires actual file:line citations. Do not implement fixes, edit reducer-owned files, or perform final synthesis inside the leaf. Return only the concise completion report."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_0535bf799ffeTOX91gk64afOdN\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 5 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Testing and integration coverage across JSON surfaces and routing lifecycle  \n**Findings**: 6 findings (5 new, 1 partially new)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.92  \n**Questions answered**: Final testing/integration question  \n**Questions remaining**: 0  \n**Edge cases**: none  \n**Recommended next focus**: Workflow-owned final synthesis\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-005.md`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one canonical append\n- `deltas/iter-005.jsonl`\n- `research.md` — progressively updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- State/delta canonical records match: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","sessionId":"ses_0535bf799ffeTOX91gk64afOdN","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research integration coverage","time":{"start":1785307859303,"end":1785308255599}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0cc6a5f0a79924d3016a69a2cdfab481918529d0deb07c1361"}},"id":"prt_faca3f49b001YTrGhHhPiH5QYN","sessionID":"ses_053835f44ffewNv42EZbxtppsV","messageID":"msg_faca3e3a7001DG99okh7vy2D6Z"}}
