rch/lineages/sol-high/deep-research-dashboard.md\n@@ -1,26 +1,27 @@\n # Deep Research Dashboard - sol-high\n \n ## Lifecycle\n - Session: `fanout-sol-high-1785305275596-oro54j`\n-- Status: iterating\n+- Status: complete\n - Stop policy: max-iterations\n-- Progress: 4/5 iterations\n+- Progress: 5/5 iterations\n \n ## Iteration Table\n | Run | Focus | newInfoRatio | Findings | Status |\n |---|---|---:|---:|---|\n | 1 | Inventory and current state | 1.00 | 6 | complete |\n | 2 | Optimization and consolidation | 0.92 | 6 | complete |\n | 3 | Automation and lifecycle ownership | 0.83 | 6 | complete |\n | 4 | Metadata-to-route effectiveness | 0.92 | 6 | complete |\n+| 5 | Testing and integration | 0.92 | 6 | complete |\n \n ## Question Status\n-- Answered: 4/5\n-- Remaining: testing and integration\n+- Answered: 5/5\n+- Remaining: none\n \n ## Convergence Trend\n-- Ratios: 1.00 -> 0.92 -> 0.83 -> 0.92\n+- Ratios: 1.00 -> 0.92 -> 0.83 -> 0.92 -> 0.92\n - Convergence is telemetry only before iteration 5.\n \n ## Dead Ends\n - Spec-folder metadata generators are not skill-root producers.\n@@ -29,11 +30,18 @@\n - Command metadata and mode registries cannot collapse without a projection.\n - Authored H routing policy cannot be generated safely from folder shape.\n - Rich hub vocabulary cannot recover root-selection misses after the wrong parent wins.\n - Key-file watch events do not regenerate unchanged graph metadata.\n+- Fixture presence is not equivalent to cross-stage behavioral coverage.\n \n ## Next Focus\n-Dimension 5: per-JSON testing and full lifecycle integration coverage.\n+Final synthesis and ranked opportunity map in `research.md`.\n \n ## Active Risks\n - Code graph unavailable; source tracing is direct.\n - No packet resource map; coverage must be established from the contract and source inventory.\n+\n+## Completion\n+- Stop reason: `maxIterationsReached`\n+- Questions answered: 5/5\n+- Findings: 30\n+- All five mechanical iteration gates passed.\n\nIndex: /Use